# project: nightly-pipeline
# sla:freshness_hours: 24
VAR patch_cycles = 0

-> ingest

=== ingest ===
Pull the nightly dumps from the vendor SFTP drop; vendor outages are expected and non-fatal.
+ [Dump retrieved] -> transform
+ [Vendor outage, retry tomorrow night] ~loop~ -> ingest

=== transform ===
Normalize the dumps into the warehouse schema; mapping bugs surface here.
+ [Transform clean] -> publish
+ {patch_cycles < 5} [Mapping bugs found, reconcile and patch] ~loop~ -> reconcile
+ {patch_cycles >= 5} [Five patch cycles exhausted, page the on-call] @human -> END

=== reconcile ===
Reconcile row counts against the source and patch the mapping.
~ patch_cycles += 1
+ [Patched, run the transform again] -> transform

=== publish ===
Publish the curated tables, write the audit trail, and notify downstream consumers within the 24-hour freshness SLA.
-> END
